Package: pgproxy
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: PostgreSQL proxy server
 pgproxy is a PostgreSQL proxy server that supports query filtering,
 signature-based blocking, read/write splitting, and transparent
 query rewriting.
